# Title: HackTool - CrackMapExec File Indicators
# ID: 736ffa74-5f6f-44ca-94ef-1c0df4f51d2a
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2024-03-11
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.001
# Description: Detects file creation events with filename patterns used by CrackMapExec.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((filemod_name:C:\\Windows\\Temp\\*) AND (((filemod_name=regex("\\\\[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}\\.txt$")) OR (filemod_name=regex("\\\\[a-zA-Z]{8}\\.tmp$"))) OR ((filemod_name:*\\temp.ps1 OR filemod_name:*\\msol.ps1))))
